    <item>
      <title>Court Blocks Trump’s White House Ban on CNN, MS NOW and Politico</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/23/business/media/cnn-ms-now-politico-white-house-trump-ban-ruling.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/23/business/media/cnn-ms-now-politico-white-house-trump-ban-ruling.html</guid>
      <atom:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/23/business/media/cnn-ms-now-politico-white-house-trump-ban-ruling.html" rel="standout"></atom:link>
      <description>Judge Timothy J. Kelly issued a temporary restraining order and told the White House to immediately restore the press credentials for the employees of the three news outlets.</description>
      <dc:creator>Erik Wemple</dc:creator>
      <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 05:59:15 +0000</pubDate>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">United States Politics and Government</category>
